WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:21.627
Put a pan on the stove.

2
00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:34.785
Turn on the stove.

3
00:00:34.786 --> 00:00:49.059
Pour the oil in the pan.

4
00:00:49.060 --> 00:01:10.700
Add some corn.

5
00:01:10.701 --> 00:01:18.878
Put the lid on.

6
00:01:18.879 --> 00:01:37.672
Wait, wait, wait.

7
00:01:37.673 --> 00:01:48.527
Pop, pop, pop.

8
00:01:48.528 --> 00:02:11.991
Shake, shake, shake the salt.

9
00:02:11.992 --> 00:02:26.914
Popcorn is everywhere!

